// Game: Postretro
// Format: Standard
// E18 projectile-trap wave fixture: the Scripting surface example (Luau twin of trap-wave.map).
// Compile: cargo run -p postretro-level-compiler -- content/dev/maps/trap-wave-luau.map -o content/dev/maps/trap-wave-luau.prl
// Step on the sweep plate (centre) and the five east-wall `wave` traps fire in
// order, three passes. Stand in the loop zone (north) and they repeat on one
